  "spriteStandard": "full-figure-1024x2048",
  "notes": [
    "Full-figure 1024x2048 sprites (the standard). Slots run past full height on purpose: heightFrac 1.75 puts head-to-hips across the frame like the IB treatment, face in the upper third, legs cropped behind the dialogue box. baselineY = heightFrac + 0.03 keeps the canvas's transparent top margin above the frame so no head crops."
